 "remarks": "Spacious custom built stone and clapboard home with stunning views of the Silvermine River and waterfalls. Contemporary open floor plan and large public rooms provide a great flow for entertaining. Gourmet kitchen with vaulted ceiling and beams opens to a large family room with fireplace. Master bedroom with fireplace has two bath areas and three walk-in closets. There is a first floor en-suite bedroom, warm paneled library, sunroom, media room and workout room. A screened porch, balconies, decks and terraces provide a place to relax and enjoy the peace and tranquility of this very special home. Located on a cul-de-sac in the charming Silvermine area.",
